@startuml auth-login
title Login and token refresh, as built (main @ fcd5371)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "User (browser)" as U
participant "api-gateway\n(nginx)" as GW
participant "user-service" as US
database "user_db" as DB

U -> GW : POST /api/auth/login\n{email, password, keepLoggedIn}
GW -> US : proxy (headers unchanged)
US -> DB : find user by LOWER(email)
DB --> US : user row (password_hash, role)
US -> US : verify password against the scrypt hash\n(unknown email: verify against a dummy hash)
alt wrong email or password
  US --> U : 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS [L1]
else correct
  US -> DB : insert session\n(refresh_token_hash, persistent, idle_expires_at)
  US -> US : sign access token with the Ed25519 private key\nclaims: sub, sid, role, iat, exp (15 min), iss, aud
  US --> U : 200 {accessToken, user}\nSet-Cookie: refresh_token (HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax,\nPath=/api/auth; ~1 day, ~30 days with keepLoggedIn) [L2, L3, L5]
end

... later, when the access token has expired ...

U -> GW : POST /api/auth/refresh (cookie)
GW -> US : proxy
US -> DB : look up session by SHA-256 of the cookie value
alt unknown, expired or already rotated
  US --> U : 401 INVALID_SESSION [L7, L10]
else valid
  US -> DB : store the new refresh_token_hash,\nextend idle_expires_at
  US -> US : sign a new access token with the user's current role
  US --> U : 200 {accessToken} + rotated cookie [L6]
end

legend bottom
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | solid arrow | request or call (control flow) |
  | dashed arrow | response or data returned |
  | alt / else | the branch the service takes |
  | [L1] | check ID in docs/evidence/d2/d2-checklist.md |
endlegend
@enduml
